{{!
    @template local_quizportal/exam_group

    What the candidate sees at once: one question, or a stimulus with its
    questions. Hidden until the exam script shows it. The question HTML comes
    from core's question engine unchanged, inputs and all.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * index - position within the section
    * part, heading, firstinpart, directions
    * label - "Câu 41–43"
    * hasstart, start - seconds into the recording (Listening only)
    * sidebyside - stimulus beside the questions (Part 6/7) rather than above
    * stimulus - rendered stimulus block, or null
    * questions - [{slot, number, html, canflag, flagged}]

    The flag button drives core's own flag checkbox inside the question HTML
    (hidden with the rest of core's question info), so the flag travels with
    every autosave and submission. It stays hidden until the script has found
    that checkbox.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "index": 0, "part": 5, "heading": "Part 5 — Hoàn thành câu", "firstinpart": true,
        "directions": "…", "label": "Câu 101", "hasstart": false, "start": null, "sidebyside": false,
        "stimulus": null, "questions": [{"slot": 124, "number": 101, "html": "<div class=\"que\"></div>",
            "canflag": true, "flagged": false}]
    }
}}
<section class="quizportal-exam__group{{#sidebyside}} quizportal-exam__group--split{{/sidebyside}}"
         data-region="group" data-index="{{index}}" data-part="{{part}}" data-label="{{label}}"
         {{#hasstart}}data-start="{{start}}"{{/hasstart}} hidden>
    {{#firstinpart}}
        <header class="quizportal-exam__part">
            <h2>{{heading}}</h2>
            <p>{{directions}}</p>
        </header>
    {{/firstinpart}}
    <div class="quizportal-exam__group-body">
        {{#stimulus}}
            <div class="quizportal-exam__stimulus">{{{stimulus}}}</div>
        {{/stimulus}}
        <div class="quizportal-exam__questions">
            {{#questions}}
                <div class="quizportal-exam__q{{#flagged}} is-flagged{{/flagged}}" data-region="question"
                     data-slot="{{slot}}" data-number="{{number}}">
                    <div class="quizportal-exam__qside">
                        <div class="quizportal-exam__qno" aria-hidden="true">{{number}}</div>
                        {{#canflag}}
                            <button type="button" class="quizportal-exam__flag" data-action="flag"
                                    aria-pressed="{{#flagged}}true{{/flagged}}{{^flagged}}false{{/flagged}}"
                                    aria-label="Đánh dấu câu {{number}}" title="Đánh dấu câu chưa chắc" hidden>
                                {{> local_quizportal/flag_icon }}
                            </button>
                        {{/canflag}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="quizportal-exam__qbody">{{{html}}}</div>
                </div>
            {{/questions}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
